gsave Tl 14.69 49.30 moveto (5) center show grestore
gsave Tl 102.69 49.30 moveto (10) center show grestore
NP W1
 Xl 79.08 159.91 133.08 159.91 LINE
 NP W1
 Xl 67.23 133.26 121.23 133.26 LINE
 NP W1
 Xl 55.39 104.61 109.39 104.61 LINE
 Xl 55.39 108.61 109.39 108.61 LINE
 NP W1
 Xl 43.54 77.96 97.54 77.96 LINE
 Xl 43.54 81.96 97.54 81.96 LINE
 NP W1
 Xl 58.69 53.30 3.00 CIRCLE 
 gsave  grestore stroke
 NP W1
 Xl 19.85 24.65 73.85 24.65 LINE
 Xl 19.85 28.65 73.85 28.65 LINE
 NP W1
 Xl 8.00 -2.00 62.00 -2.00 LINE
 Xl 8.00 2.00 62.00 2.00 LINE
 
 showpage 
